      "description": "Two-loop vacuum tadpole I_3^{a,b,c} with three internal lines of distinct masses E1, E2, E3 and arbitrary integer powers a, b, c. Section 2.1 derives explicit LTD residue formulas (Eqs. 2.9-2.11 / 2.12-2.14) covering the three surviving cuts and validates them against MATAD on the tensor cases I_222, I_232, I_332 (table after Eq. 2.14). Numerator structures include (l1.l2), (l1.l1)(p.l1)(p.l2). Topology: two vertices joined by three parallel propagators (sunrise / banana skeleton, no external momenta).",
